Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:31.84,Hook,,0,0,0,,¡HAY UN CHINGO DE\NSANGRE!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:02.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡A la verga, hay un chingo\Nde sangre! Oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.52,0:00:04.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Coño! Oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:09.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No sé ni qué está pasando.\NWhat…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.98,0:00:12.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Hermano… pero, oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.74,0:00:16.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ese wey está huyendo, wey.\N¡A la verga!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.78,0:00:18.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No mames, cabrón.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.62,0:00:20.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No pegó ninguna, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.16,0:00:22.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Me mataron.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.80,0:00:25.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Carajo! Pero…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:27.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}entonces, ¿cuál es la\Ngracia de esto?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.08,0:00:31.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No respawnea… Hermano,\N¿qué estás haciendo?
